X Coin (XFER)

A private peer-to-peer coin for simple value transfer plus user-created
assets. There is no mining. Every minute a lottery among verified-X
active nodes produces the next block and splits the subsidy.

This repository is the product home. See README.md, docs/LAUNCH.md,
docs/LOTTERY.md, and docs/ASSETS.md.

Legal copyright and historical opcode notes for the imported v4.8.0
tree are collected in docs/FORK.md. Do not treat this file as a
substitute for COPYING.
